  "id": "homogeneity",
  "term": "homogeneity",
  "definition": "In this context, homogeneity refers to regional homogeneity, an fMRI measure of how closely nearby brain locations show matching activity patterns over time. Higher or lower values suggest stronger or weaker local coordination of neural activity within that brain region.",
